[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0010","text":"制作人！突然来个猜谜～♪\n这个，怎么读～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0011","text":"爱依的手机屏幕"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0020","text":"『紫陽花』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0030","text":"啊，是紫阳花啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0040","text":"诶……！\n读得出来！好厉害！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0050","text":"在报纸什么的上面见过嘛\n不过，我懂爱依想说什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0060","text":"你是想吐槽『为什么会读成那样』对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0070","text":"对，对！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0080","text":"拆开来读的话\n不就是‘紫（murasaki）’‘阳（you）’‘花（hana）’嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0090","text":"‘a’‘ji’‘sa’‘i’\n这些读音全都不知道从哪儿冒出来的，不觉得很离谱吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900200_01_0100","text":"至少也该保留一点‘紫（murasaki）’里的‘mu’吧～"}]
